+`timescale 1ns/1ps
+
+// R1h physical payload store for the three post-autoinit NACK-index logs.
+//
+// Scientific metadata (stored count and overflow) remains in the probe.  This
+// module owns payload bits only: three independent, append-only 512x16 block
+// memories.  Payload is intentionally not reset.  Callers must use the
+// request-time stored-count snapshot to mask logically unused locations.
